# Blocks Agent/Tab/@-mention access (gitignored paths are excluded by default).
# NOTE: this is not a security sandbox — terminal and MCP tools can still read
# these paths (https://cursor.com/docs/reference/ignore-file).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/JustSlideAutomation/
**/*.sock
**/Default/Cookies
**/Default/Login Data*
